{\bkmkend AAAAAAABVU}
{{\pard\plain \s2\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\fs28\kerning28\cgrid 
How It Works
\par}
{\tc\tcl2 \v How It Works}
{
\par
\pard\plain \s140\fi-360\li360\widctlpar\fs20\cgrid 
1.\tab {\b Sensors Module} :{
\par
\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
Continuously monitors the environment and sends data to the AEB controller via message queues.\par}
\pard\plain \s140\fi-360\li360\widctlpar\fs20\cgrid 
2.\tab {\b AEB Controller} :{
\par
\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
Processes sensor data to calculate the Time to Collision (TTC).\par
\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
Decides whether to trigger alarms or activate the braking system based on predefined thresholds.\par}
\pard\plain \s140\fi-360\li360\widctlpar\fs20\cgrid 
3.\tab {\b Actuators Module} :{
\par
\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
Receives commands from the AEB controller and performs actions such as locking seatbelts, activating alarms, or engaging brakes.\par}
\pard\plain \s140\fi-360\li360\widctlpar\fs20\cgrid 
4.\tab {\b Logging} :{
\par
\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
Logs events such as alarms and braking activations for diagnostics and debugging purposes.\par
\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
Logs are stored in the {\f2 log/}  directory in a structured format.\par}
}
\par
\par}
