\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
Reads messages from the {\f2 actuators_mq}  message queue using {\f2 read_mq} .\par
\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
If a message is successfully read, it resets the {\f2 empty_mq_counter}  and processes the message using {\f2 actuatorsTranslateCanMsg} .\par
\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
If the queue is empty, increments the {\f2 empty_mq_counter} .\par
\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
Logs each processed message using {\f2 log_event} , including the current state of the actuators.\par
\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
Waits for 200 milliseconds between iterations using {\f2 usleep} .\par
\pard\plain \s121\fi-360\li720\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec }\ls1\adjustright \fs20\cgrid 
Exits the loop and prints a message when the {\f2 empty_mq_counter}  reaches {\f2 LOOP_EMPTY_ITERATIONS_MAX} .\par}
Implements {\b SwR-4} \par
