00031 {\cf20 /* Unity Attempts to Auto-Detect Integer Types}\par
00032 {\cf20  * Attempt 1: UINT_MAX, ULONG_MAX in <limits.h>, or default to 32 bits}\par
00033 {\cf20  * Attempt 2: UINTPTR_MAX in <stdint.h>, or default to same size as long}\par
00034 {\cf20  * The user may override any of these derived constants:}\par
00035 {\cf20  * UNITY_INT_WIDTH, UNITY_LONG_WIDTH, UNITY_POINTER_WIDTH */}\par
